    {
      "id": 88,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Reference numbers",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 26,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Offline benchmark (from `ml/artifacts`, 10 expanding chronological OOT windows)** — XGBoost PR-AUC 0.7682 (95 % CI [0.6881, 0.8360]), RF 0.7805, MLP 0.7663, LR 0.7613, SVM 0.2535. Friedman omnibus p = 0.000279; XGBoost is statistically indistinguishable from RF/MLP/LR (Holm-adjusted p ≥ 0.826) and beats SVM (p_adj = 0.0078).\n\n**Expected healthy human-review rate** of the causal router: 0.30 %–1.11 % per window (ml/README.md, v2.3.8). Live review rates far above this band indicate drift."
      }
